        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In Bloom: Prologue</i></strong><i> is a free version of <strong>In Bloom</strong>. Experience the core gameplay and get a taste of the experience that awaits in the full game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from masterpieces such as The Last of Us and Amnesia,  In Bloom is a survival-horror game. You play as a farmer waking up, abandoned by his family and unfamiliar with his surroundings. All you can see  around you is that what once was owned by man has now been retaken by nature. Your only hope of survival is following the instructions of a mysterious stranger whose voice you hear over a radio, instructing you to go to Save  Haven base and join the rest of the survivors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Will you survive? Will you manage to fight your way through? Or will you allow nature to overtake you as well? </strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROLOGUE FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dark ambience SFX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >voice-overs with subtitles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gun and enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In Bloom is a collaboration project made by Swedish and Polish students  of Futuregames, completed in seven weeks of development. It is made for an  audience that enjoys horror elements as well as puzzles and survival  when playing their games. Blood, sweat and tears have been put into this  project, and we hope that anyone who is about to experience it enjoys it as  much as we enjoyed making it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In Bloom: Prologue</i></strong><i> is a free version of <strong>In Bloom</strong>. Experience the core gameplay and get a taste of the experience that awaits in the full game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from masterpieces such as The Last of Us and Amnesia,  In Bloom is a survival-horror game. You play as a farmer waking up, abandoned by his family and unfamiliar with his surroundings. All you can see  around you is that what once was owned by man has now been retaken by nature. Your only hope of survival is following the instructions of a mysterious stranger whose voice you hear over a radio, instructing you to go to Save  Haven base and join the rest of the survivors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Will you survive? Will you manage to fight your way through? Or will you allow nature to overtake you as well? </strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROLOGUE FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dark ambience SFX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >voice-overs with subtitles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gun and enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In Bloom is a collaboration project made by Swedish and Polish students  of Futuregames, completed in seven weeks of development. It is made for an  audience that enjoys horror elements as well as puzzles and survival  when playing their games. Blood, sweat and tears have been put into this  project, and we hope that anyone who is about to experience it enjoys it as  much as we enjoyed making it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
        "short_description": "In Bloom is a survival-horror game where you awaken alone in a world overtaken by nature. Guided by a mysterious voice on a radio, you must solve puzzles, survive the dangers around you, and reach Safe Haven before the wilderness consumes you.",
